---

Bundled third-party files keep their own licences:

- shell/fonts/tabler.ttf — Tabler Icons, MIT License (shell/fonts/tabler-LICENSE.txt)
- shell/fonts/Geist*.ttf — Geist and Geist Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (shell/fonts/Geist-LICENSE.txt)
- shell/data/emoji.json — emoji, names and keywords built from Unicode's emoji-test.txt
  and CLDR English annotations (Unicode License v3, https://www.unicode.org/license.txt);
  rebuilt with tools/build-emoji-data.py
- shell/cursors/Slate-Cursors — the mouse cursors: Bibata Modern Ice v2.0.6 by Abdulkaiz
  Khatri (https://github.com/ful1e5/Bibata_Cursor), redrawn without colour; GNU GPL v3.0
  (shell/cursors/Slate-Cursors/LICENSE, changes in its README.md). A separate work shipped
  alongside Slate; rebuilt with tools/build-cursors.py
